OL,3,AFour tankers destroyed by naval mines
OL,4,Ain Strait of Hormuz, Iran's IRGC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour oil tankers were destroyed after
OL,7,Fhitting naval sea mines, Iran's Islamic
OL,8,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) said
OL,9,Fon Wednesday, a day after US officials
OL,10,Fsaid the US military had launched
OL,11,Fstrikes on the country.
OL,13,FThe IRGC said two of the vessels were
OL,14,Fstill burning, and two additional
OL,15,Ftankers had been seized, according to
OL,16,Fthe semi-official Tasnim news agency.
OL,17,FIt said they were trying to travel
OL,18,Fthrough a prohibited southern route in
OL,19,Fthe Strait of Hormuz.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
