OL,3,AFour tankers destroyed by naval mines
OL,4,Ain Strait of Hormuz, Iran's IRGC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has not independently verified
OL,7,Fthe IRGC's claim, which came as US
OL,8,Fvoters punished Republicans at the
OL,9,Fmidterm elections, leading Iran's top
OL,10,Fnegotiator, Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf,
OL,11,Fto say the results showed Americans had
OL,12,Fsaid no to war.
OL,14,FHe warned Washington not to betray its
OL,15,Fpublic.
